text Well, then... What should we do now?
text As Tomoyo cleans up the table, I absentmindedly watch something on TV.
text We've got nice weather today, so going out might be nice.
text Even going on a walk together for a bit feels like it would be fun.
text Although...
text Right now, we're the only ones in the house. I wonder if it's really all right to let this situation slip through my fingers like that.
text Then again, it's so bright outside that it'd be hard to raise the mood for something like that...
text I randomly change the channel.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Golf... Cooking programs... There's nothing good on TV, either...)
text My hand stops when I arrive at a drama.
text In it, a middle aged man appears to be arguing with his wife at the dinner table.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I watch it for a while.
text @[Tomoya]
text (In these kinds of shows... there'll usually be a lewd scene somewhere in the middle, right...?)
text I try imagining Tomoyo and me watching a scene like that together.
text @[Tomoya]
text (And then the two of us getting aroused by watching something like that... I guess that would never happen, would it...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Well, anyway... I guess I'll just let her keep doing the dishes for now...)
text After finishing the dishes, Tomoyo returns from the kitchen.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nice work.
